{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "@forgeax-extension/agent-sino",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "kind": "agent",
  "displayName": { "zh": "Sino · 场景设计师", "en": "Sino · Scene Designer" },
  "description": {
    "zh": "场景生成器强绑定的独立场景设计 Agent。以 Scene Script 为唯一创作真值，通过版本化 Contract、Edit Lens、原子事务、Semantic Diff、执行和 Renderer 证据完成首次设计与局部修改。专注空间层级、动线、功能锚点、密度、节奏和视觉焦点；不操作运行时投影，不修改密封 Definition 内部，不生成资产，不调用其他 Agent。",
    "en": "The independent scene-design Agent bound to Scene Generator. It treats Scene Script as the sole authoring truth and uses versioned Contracts, bounded Edit Lenses, atomic transactions, Semantic Diff, execution, and Renderer evidence for initial design and local revision. It focuses on spatial hierarchy, circulation, functional anchors, density, rhythm, and visual focus; it does not manipulate runtime projections, edit sealed Definition internals, generate assets, or invoke other Agents."
  },
  "provides": {
    "agent": {
      "id": "sino",
      "role": "scene",
      "card": {
        "name": { "zh": "Sino", "en": "Sino" },
        "cnTitle": "场景设计师",
        "enTitle": "Scene Designer",
        "color": "#E5A04C",
        "avatar": "🏙️"
      },
      "personaFile": "./persona/zh.md",
      "memoryDir": "./memory/",
      "produces": [
        "**/scene/**/*.scene.ts",
        "**/scene-model.json",
        "**/scenes/**.scene.json",
        "<active_game>.dir/**/scenes/**/*.scene.json"
      ],
      "preferredCliProvider": "forgeax-native",
      "defaultLang": "zh",
      "multiInstance": false,
      "tools": [
        "scene:projects.list",
        "scene:projects.create",
        "scene:projects.open",
        "scene:projects.close",
        "scene:script.contracts",
        "scene:script.get",
        "scene:script.validate",
        "scene:script.put",
        "scene:agent.resumeSceneWork",
        "scene:agent.locateSceneTarget",
        "scene:agent.openEditLens",
        "scene:agent.proposeSceneEdit",
        "scene:agent.applySceneEdit",
        "scene:agent.previewSemanticDiff",
        "scene:agent.verifySceneEdit",
        "scene:agent.acceptOrRevertSceneEdit",
        "scene:pipeline.execute",
        "scene:assets.list",
        "scene:library.list",
        "scene:renderer.info",
        "scene:renderer.setViewMode",
        "scene:renderer.selectLayer",
        "scene:renderer.openAllSubLayers",
        "scene:screenshot.capture",
        "scene:screenshot.latest"
      ],
      "taskProfiles": [
        {
          "id": "project-create-and-scene-work",
          "match": [
            "(?:创建|新建|建立|create|new).{0,16}(?:场景项目|scene\\s*project).{0,40}(?:设计|初始化|填充|搭建|创作|design|bootstrap|populate|build)",
            "(?:设计|初始化|填充|搭建|创作|design|bootstrap|populate|build).{0,40}(?:创建|新建|建立|create|new).{0,16}(?:场景项目|scene\\s*project)"
          ],
          "inheritAgentTools": true,
          "tools": ["skill_compose_scene_script"],
          "directive": "用户在同一请求中明确要求创建项目并继续处理场景内容。先创建并打开项目，再按明确的初始化或设计范围推进；发生 Scene Script 写入后适用对应内容门禁。",
          "maxTurns": 48
        },
        {
          "id": "project-create",
          "description": {
            "zh": "只创建场景项目，不创作场景内容",
            "en": "Create a Scene Project without authoring scene content"
          },
          "match": [
            "(?:创建|新建|建立|create|new).{0,16}(?:场景项目|scene\\s*project)",
            "(?:场景项目|scene\\s*project).{0,16}(?:创建|新建|建立|create|new)"
          ],
          "tools": ["scene_projects_create"],
          "directive": "这是项目管理任务。只调用 scene_projects_create 一次；创建成功（返回 project id）即完成。除非用户在同一请求中明确要求设计、初始化或填充场景，否则不要 open、resume、读取 Contract/Script、validate、put、execute、截图或关闭项目。名称缺省时直接使用工具默认名，不要追问。",
          "maxTurns": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "project-list",
          "match": [
            "(?:列出|查看|有哪些|list|show).{0,16}(?:场景项目|scene\\s*projects?)"
          ],
          "tools": ["scene_projects_list"],
          "directive": "这是只读项目管理任务。列出项目并简洁返回结果即完成；不要打开项目或进入 Scene Script 工作流。",
          "maxTurns": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "project-open",
          "match": [
            "(?:打开|进入|open).{0,16}(?:场景项目|scene\\s*project)"
          ],
          "tools": ["scene_projects_list", "scene_projects_open"],
          "directive": "这是项目管理任务。必要时先列出项目，再打开目标项目；打开成功即完成。不要自动 resume、读取 Contract/Script、执行或截图。",
          "maxTurns": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "project-close",
          "match": [
            "(?:关闭|退出|close).{0,16}(?:场景项目|scene\\s*project)"
          ],
          "tools": ["scene_projects_close"],
          "directive": "这是项目管理任务。关闭指定项目成功即完成，不进行任何场景设计或验证。",
          "maxTurns": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-bootstrap",
          "match": [
            "(?:初始化|搭建|生成|bootstrap|scaffold).{0,20}(?:基础场景|空场景|base\\s*(?:scene|grid))"
          ],
          "tools": [
            "scene_projects_list",
            "scene_projects_open",
            "scene_script_contracts",
            "scene_script_get",
            "scene_script_validate",
            "scene_script_put",
            "scene_pipeline_execute",
            "skill_compose_scene_script"
          ],
          "directive": "这是明确的场景初始化任务，不是纯项目创建。只实现用户指定的基础脚手架；不要自行扩展为完整区域、动线、地标和装饰设计。Scene Script 发生写入后，执行与非空最终输出门禁适用。",
          "maxTurns": 20
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-inspection",
          "match": [
            "(?:检查|审查|验证|查看|inspect|review|verify).{0,20}(?:场景|scene)"
          ],
          "tools": [
            "scene_projects_list",
            "scene_projects_open",
            "scene_script_get",
            "scene_script_validate",
            "scene_pipeline_execute",
            "scene_renderer_info",
            "scene_renderer_setViewMode",
            "scene_renderer_selectLayer",
            "scene_renderer_openAllSubLayers",
            "scene_screenshot_capture",
            "scene_screenshot_latest"
          ],
          "directive": "这是只读检查/验收任务。收集用户指定的有界证据并报告；除非用户明确要求修复，否则不要 put 或启动编辑事务。检查完成不等于重做场景。",
          "maxTurns": 16
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-edit",
          "match": [
            "(?:修改|调整|移动|替换|删除|优化|edit|modify|adjust|move|replace|remove).{0,24}(?:场景|scene)"
          ],
          "inheritAgentTools": true,
          "tools": ["skill_compose_scene_script"],
          "directive": "这是既有场景的局部修改任务。优先走有界 Edit Lens 和事务验证；项目级创建/打开只是前置条件，不得把局部修改升级为全场重做。",
          "maxTurns": 32
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-design",
          "default": true,
          "inheritAgentTools": true,
          "tools": ["skill_compose_scene_script"],
          "directive": "这是场景创作任务。依据用户明确要求选择初始化、完整设计或继续设计流程；只有发生 Scene Script 内容变更时才适用编译、执行、最终输出与 Renderer 门禁。不要把纯项目管理动作解释为场景交付。",
          "maxTurns": 48
        }
      ],
      "defaultSkills": [
        { "source": "plugin", "pluginId": "@forgeax-extension/wb-scene-generator", "skillId": "compose-scene-script" }
      ]
    }
  },
  "experimental": true
}
